                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1935: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-14T10:00:00-05:00">August 14, 1933—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>71. Legation’s 70, August 11, 1 p.m. Rio de Janeiro definitely agreed upon and
                    Brazilian Government informed. Peru suggests that negotiations begin before
                    October 1st if possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
